OL,3,GNEWSADrug driver who hit girl then
OL,4,Ablamed seizure jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who seriously injured a
OL,7,F13-year-old girl while driving under
OL,8,Fthe influence of cocaine and then
OL,9,Fclaimed that a seizure caused the
OL,10,Fcollision has been jailed.
OL,12,FDavid Campbell, 37, veered off the road
OL,13,Fon Bell Hill in Northfield on 3
OL,14,FSeptember 2024, hitting a traffic light
OL,15,Fand the girl, who was pinned against
OL,16,Frailings.
OL,18,FThe girl suffered multiple serious
OL,19,Finjuries, including a bleed on the
OL,20,Fbrain, a depressed skull fracture and a
OL,21,Ffractured spine.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
