OL,3,GNEWSADrug driver who hit girl then
OL,4,Ablamed seizure jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampbell, of Bridgeburn Road,
OL,7,FBirmingham, was found to have cocaine
OL,8,Fin his system, with traces of cannabis
OL,9,Falso detected. He pleaded guilty at
OL,10,FBirmingham Crown Court and on 14
OL,11,FOctober Campbell was sentenced to four
OL,12,Fyears and eight months.
